# Conformance probe pack for absent-value sentinels (spec 0.9) on the
# `protobuf` wire. Public. Two kinds. Exercises: a varint sentinel of 2^64-1
# (ten bytes); a `psint` sentinel compared with the varint before zig-zag; NaN
# and infinity bit patterns of `pdouble` and `pfloat` as sentinels; a
# `pstring` sentinel that begins with `=`, which is part of the text on this
# wire (ruling 12); the empty text `""`; a packed repeated scalar whose items
# without a value are written as the sentinel (ruling 5); submessage items;
# and a kind selected by `when 9 present` whose only field under 9 is
# absent, where the sentinel counts as a written field for ruling 14 of 0.5
# (ruling 16).
#
#   1 n pvarint, absent 2^64-1        5 label pstring, absent the text "=N/A"
#   2 x psint, absent the varint 1    6 uid pstring, absent ""
#   3 hae pdouble, absent 0x7ff8000000000000 (a quiet NaN)
#   4 ratio pfloat, absent 0x7f800000 (infinity)
#   7 nums: val, packed pvarint, absent 0
#   8 items: 1 qty pvarint absent 255, 2 label pstring absent "-"
#   kind sub (field 9 present): 9.1 y pvarint, absent 0
format  conformance-absent-protobuf
version 0.9.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses    probe
wire    protobuf
field   probe.n      1  pvarint  absent 18446744073709551615
field   probe.x      2  psint    absent 1
field   hae          3  pdouble  absent 9221120237041090560
field   probe.ratio  4  pfloat   absent 2139095040
field   probe.label  5  pstring  absent =N/A
field   uid          6  pstring  absent ""
group   probe.nums   7
  field  probe.val  .  pvarint  absent 0
end
group   probe.items  8
  field  probe.qty    1  pvarint  absent 255
  field  probe.label  2  pstring  absent -
end
kind     sub
when     9  present
requires probe.y
field    probe.y  9.1  pvarint  absent 0
kind     plain
